# Incursions

# Incursions for schools, early learning & vacation care

SUNSHINE COAST - BRISBANE - MELBOURNE - SYDNEY- ADELAIDE - PERTH

Schools, kindergartens and vacation care centres will enjoy our fun, educational and interactive workshops. Rhythm Culture provide drum & dance workshops to Kindergartens, Early Child Care, Primary Schools and Secondary Schools Australia wide.

We encourage learning through play, rhythm and group activity. Children will gain insight into African culture with instruments, story, song, music and dance.

These active, engaging workshops are loaded with activity and ensure children are being creative through social, cultural and musical education.

Our Drum Sing Dance programs and drum and dance workshops develop and strengthen communication skills, encourage self esteem and self confidence, engage students in leadership activities, inspires creativity and social freedom.

[Drum Sing Dance Program](/drum-sing-dance-program/)

