# SCHOOL INCURSIONS

Focus on well-being, music, rhythm and cultural celebration. These drum and dance workshops are physical, engaging and loads of fun. The students will learn a rhythm or piece of West African choreography and play or dance together as an ensemble. There are fun warm-up rhythmical exercises, call and response drumming patterns and loads more.

# KINDERGARTEN PROGRAMS

Our Drum Sing Dance programs are for kindergartens, day care centres, holiday programs, active after school care (AASC), kindergarten incursions, and outside school hours care (OSHC). Drum Sing Dance programs are a fun and engaging way to learn something new, experience group sound & rhythm, get active or bring something fresh exciting and fun to your activities.

# VACATION CARE INCURSIONS

Rhythm Culture's vacation care incursions  are for schools and child care centres during school holiday periods. These workshops are engaging, active, fun and inspiring. Every child will have a drum and will learn the dynamic rhythms and moves from West Africa! Bring rhythm, movement and fun into your centre these holidays!

