### SUNSHINE COAST SCHOOL INCURSIONS

Rhythm Culture offers exciting and interactive **Sunshine Coast school incursions**, bringing the vibrant rhythms, music and movement of West Africa into schools across the region. Our workshops include African drumming, traditional West African dance and our popular **Drum Sing Dance program**, where students explore rhythm, singing and movement while working together to create an energetic musical experience. Suitable for primary and secondary schools, our hands-on programs encourage participation, creativity, cultural learning and connection through the joy of music and dance.

